              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My kids like this made into stuffed french toast. Just make the sandwich as usual, and dip into your french toast batter. They always ask for seconds."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
