            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BEARLYBARBIE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "If you leave your sandwich open long enough for the honey to soak into the bread, then close it up; it's even better. I've been making these since I was a kid (now in my 40's). Also very good with thinly sliced banana on it.",
            "datePublished": "2012-02-05T13:29:23.560Z"
          },
          {
