              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MaryLou"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This sandwich was yummy and brought back memories from childhood. I used cashew butter instead of peanut butter (due to allergy). It was a tasty lunch. The butter didn't really add anything for me, so I will probably leave it out next time.",
            "datePublished": "2024-05-14T18:24:52.493Z"
          },
