              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "litg8r"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've been eating peanut butter and honey sandwiches for decades. I prefer honey rather than jelly on my peanut butter sandwich. My honey preference is to use whipped honey. I find whipped honey has a milder sweeter flavor because of the added air. Yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2025-08-09T01:38:04.817Z"
          },
